    "gp_section_610324564739687378": {
      "type": "gp-section-610324564739687378",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "eed02e9d02f692080388dcc1bf95596b56b3aea4e477379cbe6b95b3422c4054_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggkniwjg1Fr_text": "<strong>Nog </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);\"><i><strong>Vragen?</strong></i></span>",
        "ggdcoTbazk6_text": "<p>FusiForce is de eerste zuivere creatine gummy die echt werkt.</p>",
        "gghICwHbGvV_label": "<p>PROBEER FUSIFORCE VANDAAG!</p>",
        "ggIQr6cuOI4_childItem_0": "<p>GRATIS verzending vanaf 65 €</p>",
        "ggMBH7oYco4_childItem_0": "<p>Klantenservice 24/7</p>",
        "ggiq7zJ_fAj_childItem_0": "<p>90 Dagen Geld-Terug-Garantie</p>",
        "ggIjn8cneWS_childItem_0": "<p>Meer dan 137.235 tevreden klanten</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_0": "<p>Hoe verschilt FusiForce van andere creatine gummies?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_1": "<p>Kunnen vrouwen FusiForce Creatine Gummies gebruiken?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_2": "<p>Wordt FusiForce onafhankelijk getest en geverifieerd op zuiverheid?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_3": "<p>Waarom zakjes met individuele porties?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_4": "<p>Hoe lang duurt het voordat ik resultaat zie?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_5": "<p>Wat als het niet werkt voor mij?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_6": "<p>Kan FusiForce een opgeblazen gevoel of maagklachten veroorzaken?</p>",
        "ggK27PSUNQ0_text": "<p>While other brands test their powder before cooking (then destroy the creatine with heat), we test the finished gummies after cooking — and publish the lab reports. Our founder spent 10 months perfecting every detail, personally audited 50+ manufacturers, and is the only one willing to take full accountability. Result? 5,000 mg of real, verified creatine in just 3 gummies. Most customers who switched from Amazon brands say it’s the first time they actually felt the difference</p>",
        "ggzyMOMHA9n_text": "<p>Yes — 100% safe for women. Many of our customers in perimenopause or menopause use it daily for mental clarity, energy, and recovery (not just muscle). The clinical 5g dose works the same for everyone. Start with 3 gummies per day — you’ll feel sharper within 2–3 weeks</p>",
        "gg7jmTRUEzD_text": "<p>Every single batch is tested by an ISO 17025 accredited lab after cooking. We publish the <a href=\"#g3wTy8wfqJ\"><u>full COA right here</u></a>. No other gummy brand shows you post-cooking results. That’s why 8 of the top 10 Amazon brands failed independent tests — we refused to play that game</p>",
        "ggUHrOh1j9E_text": "<p>Het kostte ons 2 jaar om het smeltprobleem op te lossen. Elke portie van 3 gummies is voorgedoseerd en beschermd. Gooi er een in je sporttas zonder bakje. Geen plakkerige rommel.</p>",
        "ggD-NsRVdUC_text": "<p>Most people notice better workouts and mental clarity in 7–14 days. Full strength and recovery benefits hit around week 3–4. That’s exactly why we recommend the 2-pouch Performance Pack — it gives you a full 60-day trial so you can feel the difference risk-free.</p>",
        "gg6KCjI5kR7_text": "<p>Then we don’t want your money. Use the entire pouch (or even empty it) and email us within 90 days. We’ll refund every penny — no questions, no restocking fees, and we even cover return shipping. Over 12,847 customers have trusted this promise</p>",
        "ggUWlKQpi93_text": "<p>Nee. Omdat we pure creatine monohydraat gebruiken (geen goedkope vulstoffen) en elke partij na productie testen, is een opgeblazen gevoel extreem zeldzaam. De kleine portie van 3 gummies + Panax Ginseng helpt bij de meeste mensen juist de spijsvertering. Als je je ooit niet lekker voelt in de eerste 90 dagen, betalen we je direct terug.</p>"
      }
    },
